      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start for the actual content part.\n\nthough, i just ran your draft through the previewer for the HR dashboard and the score came back way lower than i expected. it's basically flagged as \"low impact\" because of the index score. \n\ni know i said not to spam it, but if the score is too low, leadership might not even bother reading the report. can you try a second draft? i need you to make it a bit more robust so it actually registers on the dashboard, but please... please keep it professional. i don't want it to look like a list of buzzwords. just try to make it a bit more \"meaningful\" in the eyes of the metric so it actually gets seen.",
